02:27.297 --> 02:30.255
NO REGRETS FOR MY YOUTH

02:41.797 --> 02:44.172
The Cos-Prayers unmasked?

02:44.672 --> 02:45.964
Yes.

02:46.422 --> 02:52.047
A joint photo shoot for Taiyou Corp and the
trademark section of Houchiku Productions.

02:52.380 --> 02:55.505
So, after bloomers, we have school swimsuits?

02:55.505 --> 02:58.964
All aboard the fetish-gear express, huh?

02:58.964 --> 03:04.589
COS-PRAYERS UNMASKED
COLORS PHOTO ALBUM

02:58.966 --> 03:00.797
But it's getting an amazing reaction.

03:00.922 --> 03:03.339
The pre-orders right now are selling out.

03:04.880 --> 03:07.964
Maybe that's why they're so enthusiastic.

03:08.214 --> 03:11.922
Well, quite a few people are here to sightsee.

03:14.922 --> 03:19.880
But, if I'm seen like this, I'll never
be able to get in front of a camera!

03:27.880 --> 03:28.922
Natsumi!

03:36.630 --> 03:39.339
Yes? What is it?

03:40.422 --> 03:43.964
I thought my job was done.

03:49.380 --> 03:50.797
BIG SCOOP!

03:49.381 --> 03:50.797
HEROINE'S

03:49.382 --> 03:50.797
TRUE FACE!

03:56.714 --> 03:58.505
Both of you...

03:59.339 --> 04:01.464
Could you explain this?

04:09.380 --> 04:13.089
We went to a hotel together. That part is true.

04:13.214 --> 04:15.297
Just like the photos show.

04:16.297 --> 04:21.630
As opposed to a normal high schooler like
you, this is a major problem for Natsumi!

04:22.380 --> 04:24.255
I...!

04:25.005 --> 04:26.839
I...!

04:28.130 --> 04:30.714
I lured him into it!

04:32.714 --> 04:34.755
I'm sorry.

04:36.047 --> 04:37.547
Natsumi!

04:37.630 --> 04:38.922
That's not true!

04:39.339 --> 04:42.297
I lured her into it.

04:42.297 --> 04:43.630
I'm sorry.

04:48.505 --> 04:53.339
After you apologize, you are to
never come near Natsumi again!

04:53.464 --> 04:55.880
We're leaving, Natsumi!

04:58.005 --> 05:00.172
Ooizumi...

05:00.172 --> 05:03.047
This is a critical time for the Cos-Prayers.

05:03.047 --> 05:05.714
I'll pass the making-of video on to someone else.

05:07.464 --> 05:10.130
From now on, you're barred from the set.

05:11.755 --> 05:12.880
Right.

05:14.505 --> 05:15.922
Well, in any case,

05:16.089 --> 05:20.380
I've gotten the truth of
what happened from the girl.

05:22.297 --> 05:25.089
Well, there's plenty I'd like to tell you about it,

05:25.964 --> 05:28.880
but for today, just leave it be and go home.

05:30.297 --> 05:32.589
G-good night!

05:36.714 --> 05:37.714
Hey, Kid!

05:38.255 --> 05:39.589
Y-yes, sir?

05:40.297 --> 05:43.047
The way we on-site staff see it,

05:43.047 --> 05:48.422
heroines are like goddesses
who are the face of a TV series.

05:50.755 --> 05:56.464
I dunno why they choose a kid
like you to be a cameraman,

05:56.547 --> 05:58.297
and I don't care.

05:58.422 --> 06:02.005
But I don't want you sticking your face
in here so you can fool around like a kid!

06:11.714 --> 06:13.547
That's why I...

06:14.672 --> 06:19.089
I still love hero shows, and I go to the auditions.

06:19.172 --> 06:22.714
I want to show kids today a new kind of hero!

06:28.297 --> 06:30.964
What have I done?

06:32.089 --> 06:36.839
And so, just like that, my dream was over.

06:38.630 --> 06:40.755
We're canceled?!

06:41.130 --> 06:45.380
At first, I also put a lot of the blame on you,

06:45.714 --> 06:48.172
but that wasn't the only cause of this.

06:48.880 --> 06:51.630
There were tons of other problems, too.

06:52.797 --> 06:55.672
No. It wasn't your fault.

06:56.089 --> 06:58.630
I just didn't have the strength to keep it together.

07:04.630 --> 07:06.797
What have I done?

07:09.672 --> 07:11.005
Yes?

07:11.005 --> 07:12.255
Ooizumi?

07:12.255 --> 07:13.464
Yagami!

07:15.797 --> 07:18.505
My boss has been keeping a close eye
on me since we were caught.

07:18.505 --> 07:22.089
INUI

07:18.964 --> 07:22.089
I told her I was staying over at Matsuri's place.

07:22.255 --> 07:23.755
Hang in there!

07:23.880 --> 07:24.755
Dummy!

07:27.130 --> 07:28.547
Yagami.

07:30.464 --> 07:31.589
I'm sorry.

07:32.630 --> 07:36.797
No. I should be the one apologizing.

07:37.297 --> 07:40.797
You're barred from the set now, aren't you?

07:40.964 --> 07:45.630
It's okay. Besides, it looks like
it was all a big mistake.

07:45.630 --> 07:46.714
Huh?

07:46.714 --> 07:51.547
The truth is, my proposal getting accepted
was from Ikita's mistake.

07:51.880 --> 07:54.464
Mine and the one written by Takahara-sensei...

07:54.464 --> 07:58.172
got switched around, and she
sent it to the sponsors by mistake.

07:58.339 --> 08:00.922
That's the reason for the secrecy?

08:00.922 --> 08:03.172
It was a reward way beyond
what I should have gotten.

08:03.464 --> 08:06.714
A kid with no pull, the creator of a TV show.

08:06.797 --> 08:09.089
That's not true!

08:09.089 --> 08:11.672
The day I auditioned for the show...

08:12.464 --> 08:16.964
When I went and saw there was a swimsuit
judging, even though this was for a kid's show,

08:17.047 --> 08:20.255
I couldn't see what the reason was,
and I wasn't really into it.

08:20.839 --> 08:22.839
But when I read the project planning book,

08:22.922 --> 08:26.255
I changed my mind, and thought I'd like to do it.

08:26.839 --> 08:29.464
I don't really understand planning and that stuff,

08:30.505 --> 08:32.922
but it was so clear to me that...

08:33.005 --> 08:37.214
whoever wrote that proposal
really loved hero shows.

08:37.464 --> 08:39.089
Yagami...

08:39.797 --> 08:43.797
But, canceling it is just too much!

08:44.297 --> 08:46.172
I want to do something...

08:48.380 --> 08:52.089
I'd like to do something about it, too.

08:52.297 --> 08:56.672
But, in the end, I'm just an
ordinary high school student.

08:57.297 --> 09:00.005
There's no place for me.

09:04.130 --> 09:06.089
Coward.

09:07.464 --> 09:11.589
Dammit! What am I supposed to do?!

09:11.589 --> 09:14.505
There's nothing I can do to stop this!

09:14.880 --> 09:18.630
It was all I could do to write
a half-assed proposal!

09:19.589 --> 09:22.089
It was so clear to me that...

09:22.089 --> 09:26.297
whoever wrote that proposal
really loved hero shows.

09:28.505 --> 09:29.589
Write...

09:35.714 --> 09:37.005
Okay, then!

09:42.089 --> 09:46.005
SUPER TRANSFORMING COSPLAYERS THE CLIMAX
(Proposed)
by Naoto Ooizumi

09:42.094 --> 09:46.005
I can't tell you how good or bad the script is,

09:46.339 --> 09:48.672
but if you're just scribbling it down
and trusting in your force of will,

09:48.672 --> 09:52.797
don't you think you should try
to make it a little more polished?

09:52.964 --> 09:55.089
You think so?

09:57.922 --> 09:59.630
Thank you.

10:02.714 --> 10:03.464
Hey!

10:03.672 --> 10:05.089
Yes?

10:05.089 --> 10:08.505
I admire you for coming back here
again and not running away...

10:08.964 --> 10:10.755
Mr. Author.

10:20.630 --> 10:23.297
Are you sure about this?
It sounds like fun.

10:23.505 --> 10:28.172
So, Cruce was taken over by evil,
but he was still watching over us.

10:28.505 --> 10:31.464
It's that soothing quality
that makes it perfect for me.

10:32.589 --> 10:34.339
Ooizumi!

10:34.880 --> 10:38.130
I really wanted you to read it.

10:40.172 --> 10:45.755
Say, if we get them to read this,
you think they might restart the series?

10:45.880 --> 10:50.047
Nirazawa didn't think it was
polished and didn't really go for it.

10:50.339 --> 10:51.755
Oh...

10:51.755 --> 10:54.089
That's cuz that dude's old.

10:54.630 --> 10:57.630
Girls these days, letting their panties show!

10:57.714 --> 10:59.630
No sense of modesty!

10:59.755 --> 11:03.255
Heh, if we're scared to be seen,
miniskirts wouldn't be in such demand!

11:08.047 --> 11:11.255
Everyone's really fired up now, huh?

11:11.255 --> 11:12.047
Miku!

11:12.214 --> 11:14.214
Huh? Do you have business here?

11:14.214 --> 11:16.964
This is no place for a little kid to come to alone.

11:17.339 --> 11:19.880
I came here with my boyfriend!

11:21.839 --> 11:23.755
Whoa, that's a loaded statement!

11:23.755 --> 11:25.589
Miku, you have a boyfriend?

11:25.589 --> 11:27.547
What?! I got left behind?

11:30.130 --> 11:35.172
Why don't we both try one last time
to get them to accept the script?

11:37.505 --> 11:41.130
If they say no, I can just rewrite it, right?

11:41.130 --> 11:43.214
That won't be necessary.

11:45.964 --> 11:47.380
K-Kurume!

11:47.380 --> 11:49.297
You were here?!

11:49.297 --> 11:50.964
Wha...? What's going on?

11:51.297 --> 11:53.672
Just tweak it a little.

11:53.672 --> 11:57.797
Fundamentally, I think we can use it.

11:57.797 --> 11:59.089
Use it...?

11:59.922 --> 12:04.422
Depriving our viewers of such
enthusiasm would be a waste.

12:04.797 --> 12:06.464
That's what Nirazawa said.

12:08.255 --> 12:09.297
Then...!

12:19.714 --> 12:21.380
The final sortie, huh?

12:25.714 --> 12:26.797
Let's go, everyone!

12:27.172 --> 12:28.214
Okay!

12:28.464 --> 12:31.255
Now, we'll give this all we've got!

12:33.255 --> 12:37.589
It looks like my dream gets to last a little longer.

12:53.880 --> 12:59.214
You might notice, as I peep through the viewfinder

12:59.505 --> 13:02.422
That you're the only one

13:02.422 --> 13:06.339
That I was following

13:06.964 --> 13:09.797
Bit by bit, our time together

13:09.797 --> 13:13.005
Starts to overlap

13:13.839 --> 13:16.214
And these feelings I can't hide

13:16.214 --> 13:20.005
Don't have to be hidden anymore

13:20.839 --> 13:24.297
Like the moon and the stars long ago

13:24.297 --> 13:26.922
Once promised

13:27.672 --> 13:31.214
The two of us will always

13:31.214 --> 13:34.922
Be connected

13:35.005 --> 13:38.255
Stronger than anyone, closer than anyone

13:38.255 --> 13:41.714
Yes, I'm here to love you

13:41.964 --> 13:45.297
In my eyes and in my heart

13:45.297 --> 13:48.547
You blaze for me

13:48.672 --> 13:52.005
Even if the winds blow and the rains fall

13:52.214 --> 13:55.464
I'll stay with you, as long as we're together

13:55.589 --> 13:59.089
Yesterday, surely, tomorrow, even moreso

13:59.089 --> 14:02.964
You'll be that much dearer to me

14:08.922 --> 14:23.964
NEXT
EPISODE

14:09.839 --> 14:13.380
To everyone who's supported
Super Transforming Cosplayers,

14:13.380 --> 14:17.297
will you add your voices to call for its renewal?

14:18.339 --> 14:20.089
We'll be waiting for everyone...

14:20.089 --> 14:23.255
at the Nogai Stage in Shiba Park
at noon in one week.

14:27.547 --> 14:31.047
To everyone who's supported

14:27.548 --> 14:31.047
Super Transforming Cosplayers,
